        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Door Latch for Omnia Brass Leversets</b>\r\n<p>For  <a href=\"/collections/omnia-levers\"><b>Omnia Brass Leversets</b></a> (levers made from brass). \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: Use with door levers only (NOT <a href=\"/collections/omnia-knobs\"><b>Omnia Door Knobs</b></a>). Not for use with <a href=\"/collections/omnia-stainless-steel-levers\"><b>Omnia Stainless Door Levers</b></a> as they use a 8 mm hub. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/latch-for-omnia-knobsets\">Omnia Knob Latch</a> and <a href=\"/products/latch-for-omnia-stainless-steel-leversets\">Omnia Stainless Steel Latch</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Available for Passage (Hall/Closet) or Privacy (Bath/Bedroom)  functions in 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with Omnia Brass door levers with a 7 mm hub for the spindle. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
